# Apps Script web app /exec URL — see apps-script/Code.gs for deployment steps.
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your own URL in. For the GitHub Pages
# build, set it as the repository variable VITE_VOTE_ENDPOINT instead.
#
# This value is compiled into the published site and is therefore public. That
# is fine: the script only ever records votes. Never put a Google API key or a
# service-account credential in any VITE_ variable.
VITE_VOTE_ENDPOINT=
